1
00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:09,462
Namaste!

2
00:00:09,502 --> 00:00:12,560
Medoro Pharmacy mein aapka swagat hai.

3
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:19,409
Medoro Pharmacy Bharat ki medical stores ke liye
bana software hai, jismein billing,

4
00:00:19,449 --> 00:00:24,137
inventory, purchase, GST aur accounting, sab ek
jagah hai.

5
00:00:24,890 --> 00:00:26,268
Yeh kiske liye hai?

6
00:00:26,308 --> 00:00:32,088
Mohalle ki medical store aur retail pharmacy,
aspataal aur clinic ki pharmacy,

7
00:00:32,128 --> 00:00:35,819
aur kai branches wali pharmacy chains, sabke
liye.

8
00:00:36,577 --> 00:00:42,082
Mukhya faayde: keyboard se tez billing, FEFO se
expiry ka kam nuksaan,

9
00:00:42,122 --> 00:00:48,974
Schedule H ki jaanch, GST reports, internet band
hone par bhi billing, Hindi interface,

10
00:00:49,014 --> 00:00:51,985
aur data aapke apne Google Drive mein.

11
00:00:52,762 --> 00:00:55,133
Ab software ke andar chalte hain.

12
00:00:55,173 --> 00:01:00,468
Yeh hamaari demo pharmacy ka dashboard hai,
Medoro Demo Pharmacy, Ranchi,

13
00:01:00,508 --> 00:01:04,414
jismein pichhle ek mahine ka kaalpanik data
bhara hai.

14
00:01:05,174 --> 00:01:09,792
Upar aaj ki bikri, margin, khareed, kharch aur
bakaaya.

15
00:01:09,832 --> 00:01:13,095
Beech mein bikri ka chart aur insights.

16
00:01:13,135 --> 00:01:17,161
Neeche low stock, expiry aur branch performance.

17
00:01:17,201 --> 00:01:21,311
In sabko hum agle parts mein vistaar se
dekhenge.

18
00:01:27,376 --> 00:01:27,940
Namaste!

19
00:01:27,980 --> 00:01:31,941
Medoro Pharmacy ke is tutorial mein aapka swagat
hai.

20
00:01:31,981 --> 00:01:37,301
Is part mein hum dekhenge ki Medoro par apna
account kaise banate hain,

21
00:01:37,341 --> 00:01:41,528
use verify kaise karte hain, aur login kaise
karte hain.

22
00:01:42,301 --> 00:01:45,563
Sabse pehle browser mein medoro.in kholiye.

23
00:01:45,603 --> 00:01:48,711
Upar menu mein Pharmacy par click kijiye.

24
00:01:49,480 --> 00:01:53,197
Yahan Medoro Pharmacy ke saare features, pricing

25
00:01:53,237 --> 00:01:59,929
aur data security ki jaankari hai: billing,
inventory, GST, accounts aur AI assistant.

26
00:02:03,104 --> 00:02:08,196
Ab upar daayin taraf 'Start 7-day free trial'
button par click kijiye.

27
00:02:08,236 --> 00:02:13,035
Saat din ka trial bilkul free hai, aur koi card
nahi maanga jaata.

28
00:02:13,794 --> 00:02:15,608
Yeh asli sign-up page hai.

29
00:02:15,648 --> 00:02:20,099
Yahan aap Google account se ya email se sign up
kar sakte hain.

30
00:02:20,869 --> 00:02:26,272
Dhyan dijiye: is video ke liye hum ek alag demo
server istemaal kar rahe hain,

31
00:02:26,312 --> 00:02:29,621
taaki kisi asli pharmacy ka data na chhua jaaye.

32
00:02:29,661 --> 00:02:33,878
Demo server par Medoro ka bilkul yahi software
chal raha hai,

33
00:02:33,918 --> 00:02:36,390
aur ismein saara data kaalpanik hai.

34
00:02:37,138 --> 00:02:42,078
Email se sign up karne ke liye apna email
address daaliye aur 'Send code' dabaaiye.

35
00:02:42,854 --> 00:02:47,470
Medoro aapke email par chhah ankon ka
verification code bhejta hai,

36
00:02:47,510 --> 00:02:49,833
jo das minute tak valid rehta hai.

37
00:02:49,873 --> 00:02:55,462
Email se code dekhkar yahan daaliye, aur
'Confirm and continue' par click kijiye.

38
00:02:56,228 --> 00:02:57,834
Email confirm ho gaya!

39
00:02:57,874 --> 00:03:01,875
Ab pharmacy ki details bharne wala form khul
gaya hai.

40
00:03:01,915 --> 00:03:06,066
Yeh onboarding hum agle part mein step by step
bharenge.

41
00:03:08,136 --> 00:03:12,874
Ab dekhte hain ki login aur account ki suraksha
kaise kaam karti hai.

42
00:03:12,914 --> 00:03:14,951
Pehle hum sign out karte hain.

43
00:03:15,709 --> 00:03:18,817
Sign in page par apna email aur password
daaliye.

44
00:03:25,425 --> 00:03:30,054
Owner aur manager ke account par two-step
verification zaroori hai.

45
00:03:30,094 --> 00:03:34,304
Authenticator app mein dikh raha chhah ankon ka
code daaliye.

46
00:03:34,344 --> 00:03:39,043
Agar phone paas na ho, to recovery code bhi
istemaal kar sakte hain.

47
00:03:39,083 --> 00:03:43,502
Apne counter PC ko tees din ke liye trusted bhi
bana sakte hain.

48
00:03:44,257 --> 00:03:46,022
Bas, aap andar aa gaye.

49
00:03:46,062 --> 00:03:49,631
Ab password bhool jaane ki sthiti dekhte hain.

50
00:03:49,671 --> 00:03:53,554
Sign out karke 'Forgot password' par click
kijiye.

51
00:03:54,303 --> 00:03:58,137
Apna registered email daaliye aur 'Send code'
dabaaiye.

52
00:03:58,177 --> 00:04:02,151
Medoro us email par chhah ankon ka reset code
bhejta hai,

53
00:04:02,191 --> 00:04:04,827
jo pandrah minute tak valid rehta hai.

54
00:04:05,570 --> 00:04:10,551
Email se code dekhkar yahan daaliye, phir naya
password do baar likhiye.

55
00:04:10,591 --> 00:04:15,782
Dhyan dijiye: password badalte hi aap har device
se sign out ho jaate hain,

56
00:04:15,822 --> 00:04:20,036
aur login par two-step verification phir bhi
laagu rehta hai.

57
00:04:21,349 --> 00:04:22,704
Password badal gaya.

58
00:04:22,744 --> 00:04:27,516
Ab naye password aur authenticator code se
dobara sign in karte hain.

59
00:04:38,500 --> 00:04:43,620
Security ke liye yaad rakhiye: password kam se
kam das characters ka rakhiye,

60
00:04:43,660 --> 00:04:46,502
recovery codes offline sambhaalkar rakhiye,

61
00:04:46,542 --> 00:04:52,198
aur paanch baar galat password daalne par
account kuch der ke liye lock ho jaata hai.

62
00:04:52,238 --> 00:04:54,879
Medoro mein koi default login nahi hota.

63
00:05:00,942 --> 00:05:05,023
Is part mein hum pharmacy ka onboarding poora
karenge.

64
00:05:05,063 --> 00:05:11,890
Upar chhah steps dikh rahe hain: Pharmacy, Your
account, Branches, Team, Backups aur Done.

65
00:05:12,651 --> 00:05:15,104
Pehla field hai pharmacy ka naam.

66
00:05:15,144 --> 00:05:19,032
Wahi naam likhiye jo aapke bill par chhapna
chahiye.

67
00:05:19,072 --> 00:05:22,053
Hum likh rahe hain Medoro Demo Pharmacy.

68
00:05:22,798 --> 00:05:24,099
Ab GSTIN daaliye.

69
00:05:24,139 --> 00:05:30,171
GSTIN pandrah characters ka hota hai, aur Medoro
uska format check karta hai.

70
00:05:30,211 --> 00:05:35,849
Dekhiye, agar hum adhoora GSTIN daalein, to
Continue par error aata hai.

71
00:05:36,602 --> 00:05:38,702
Ab poora GSTIN daalte hain.

72
00:05:38,742 --> 00:05:43,616
Is demo ka GSTIN aur drug licence number, dono
kaalpanik hain.

73
00:05:43,656 --> 00:05:48,689
Drug licence yaani Form 20B aur 21B ka number
zaroori field hai,

74
00:05:48,729 --> 00:05:51,543
kyunki yeh har bill par chhapta hai.

75
00:05:52,317 --> 00:05:55,918
Registered pharmacist ka naam aur registration
number,

76
00:05:55,958 --> 00:06:01,110
aur pharmacy ka poora address bhi bhariye, city,
state aur PIN code ke saath.

77
00:06:01,851 --> 00:06:05,347
Pharmacy code aapke staff ke login ke liye hai.

78
00:06:05,387 --> 00:06:11,216
Counter par staff yeh code, apna employee ID aur
PIN daalkar login karte hain.

79
00:06:11,256 --> 00:06:16,182
Interface language baad mein bhi badal sakte
hain: English, Hindi,

80
00:06:16,222 --> 00:06:18,590
ya English ke saath Hinglish AI.

81
00:06:19,348 --> 00:06:21,317
Continue par click kijiye.

82
00:06:21,357 --> 00:06:23,480
Agla step hai owner account.

83
00:06:23,520 --> 00:06:29,352
Medoro mein koi default login nahi hota: yeh
account pharmacy ka maalik hai,

84
00:06:29,392 --> 00:06:31,747
aur baaki sabko yahi jodta hai.

85
00:06:32,488 --> 00:06:35,582
Owner ka naam aur mobile number daaliye.

86
00:06:35,622 --> 00:06:38,325
Email pehle hi verify ho chuka hai.

87
00:06:38,365 --> 00:06:44,358
Password kam se kam das characters ka rakhiye,
aur use dobara confirm kijiye.

88
00:06:45,119 --> 00:06:46,985
Ab branches aur counters.

89
00:06:47,025 --> 00:06:52,703
Pehli branch ka naam Main Road rakhte hain, aur
usmein do billing counters.

90
00:06:52,743 --> 00:06:56,438
Phir Kanke Road naam ki doosri branch jodte
hain.

91
00:06:57,203 --> 00:07:03,299
Team step mein aap staff ko invite kar sakte
hain: manager, pharmacist, cashier,

92
00:07:03,339 --> 00:07:05,063
accountant ya delivery.

93
00:07:05,103 --> 00:07:08,284
Manager ko email se invite karna hota hai.

94
00:07:08,324 --> 00:07:12,042
Har invite code adtaalees ghante valid rehta
hai.

95
00:07:14,423 --> 00:07:15,201
Ab backups.

96
00:07:15,241 --> 00:07:20,701
Medoro mein pharmacy ka data aapke apne Google
Drive mein rakha jaata hai,

97
00:07:20,741 --> 00:07:24,714
aisi key se encrypt karke jo sirf aapke paas
hoti hai.

98
00:07:24,754 --> 00:07:29,843
Recovery kit download karke use offline,
surakshit jagah par rakhiye.

99
00:07:30,593 --> 00:07:36,100
Dono checkbox tick kijiye: recovery kit
sambhaalkar rakhne wala, aur Terms

100
00:07:36,140 --> 00:07:37,900
aur Privacy policy wala.

101
00:07:37,940 --> 00:07:41,123
Phir 'Create my pharmacy' par click kijiye.

102
00:07:41,870 --> 00:07:43,452
Pharmacy taiyaar hai!

103
00:07:43,492 --> 00:07:47,853
Yahan pharmacy code aur team ke invite codes
dikhte hain.

104
00:07:47,893 --> 00:07:51,251
Agla zaroori step hai two-step verification.

105
00:07:52,002 --> 00:07:55,456
'Set up two-step verification' par click kijiye.

106
00:07:55,496 --> 00:07:59,750
Apne phone ke authenticator app se yeh QR code
scan kijiye.

107
00:07:59,790 --> 00:08:04,700
Video mein QR code aur key suraksha ke liye
dhundhle kiye gaye hain.

108
00:08:05,463 --> 00:08:09,475
App mein dikh raha chhah ankon ka code daaliye
aur Verify kijiye.

109
00:08:11,193 --> 00:08:13,671
Ab das recovery codes dikhte hain.

110
00:08:13,711 --> 00:08:18,114
Phone kho jaane par har code ek baar login ke
kaam aata hai.

111
00:08:18,154 --> 00:08:22,854
Inhein download karke offline rakhiye; yeh
dobara nahi dikhenge.

112
00:08:23,603 --> 00:08:25,779
Aakhri setup hai Drive storage.

113
00:08:25,819 --> 00:08:34,713
Live Medoro mein pehle aap apna Google Drive
connect karte hain; is demo server par Google
Drive ka ek test version juda hai.

114
00:08:34,753 --> 00:08:37,572
'Set up Drive storage' par click kijiye.

115
00:08:38,333 --> 00:08:42,903
Medoro encryption keys aur ek Drive recovery
code banata hai.

116
00:08:42,943 --> 00:08:46,606
Yeh code naye device par data kholne ke liye
hai,

117
00:08:46,646 --> 00:08:49,856
aur Medoro ke paas iski koi copy nahi hoti.

118
00:08:49,896 --> 00:08:51,821
Ise bhi surakshit rakhiye.

119
00:08:52,594 --> 00:08:56,486
Ab 'Start my pharmacy on this device' par click
kijiye.

120
00:08:56,526 --> 00:09:00,703
Aapki medicines, stock, bills aur customers isi
device par,

121
00:09:00,743 --> 00:09:04,706
aur encrypted roop mein aapke Google Drive mein
rahenge.

122
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:09,764
Onboarding poora ho gaya, aur dashboard khul
gaya hai!

123
00:09:09,804 --> 00:09:11,366
Abhi sab khaali hai.

124
00:09:11,406 --> 00:09:16,972
Agle parts mein hum medicines, stock, suppliers
aur customers jodenge.

125
00:09:23,036 --> 00:09:26,596
Login karte hi Medoro ka dashboard khulta hai.

126
00:09:26,636 --> 00:09:32,308
Yahan ek hi screen par aaj ki bikri, munafa,
khareed, kharch aur bakaaya,

127
00:09:32,348 --> 00:09:33,873
sab kuch dikhta hai.

128
00:09:33,913 --> 00:09:38,568
Upar Today, saat din aur tees din ke beech badal
sakte hain.

129
00:09:39,338 --> 00:09:43,628
Sales today mein aaj ki kul bikri aur bills ki
ginti hai.

130
00:09:43,668 --> 00:09:49,630
Gross margin batata hai ki GST se pehle, returns
ghataakar, kitna munafa bacha.

131
00:09:50,402 --> 00:09:54,799
Purchases mein supplier bills, aur Expenses mein
aaj ke kharch.

132
00:09:54,839 --> 00:09:58,039
Receivables yaani customers se kitna lena hai,

133
00:09:58,079 --> 00:10:01,349
aur Payables yaani suppliers ko kitna dena hai.

134
00:10:02,126 --> 00:10:04,636
Ab tees din wala view dekhte hain.

135
00:10:04,676 --> 00:10:10,486
Sales chart har din ki bikri GST sahit dikhata
hai, aur neeche cash, UPI, card

136
00:10:10,526 --> 00:10:13,561
aur credit mein collection ka hisaab hai.

137
00:10:14,314 --> 00:10:17,257
Insights box zaroori baatein khud batata hai,

138
00:10:17,297 --> 00:10:20,240
jaise kitna stock jaldi expire hone wala hai,

139
00:10:20,280 --> 00:10:23,488
ya kaunsi medicines reorder level se neeche
hain.

140
00:10:24,255 --> 00:10:26,149
Neeche Low stock ki list hai,

141
00:10:26,189 --> 00:10:31,618
aur 'Expiring within 90 days' mein woh batches
jo nabbe din ke andar expire honge,

142
00:10:31,657 --> 00:10:34,085
unki keemat aur bache dinon ke saath.

143
00:10:34,825 --> 00:10:38,310
Branch performance mein har branch ki bikri
dikhti hai,

144
00:10:38,350 --> 00:10:41,963
aur saath mein Google Drive ki aakhri full copy
ka samay,

145
00:10:42,003 --> 00:10:44,783
taaki aapko pata rahe ki data surakshit hai.

146
00:10:45,546 --> 00:10:50,202
Sabse neeche Recent activity mein har bill aur
badlaav ka record hai.

147
00:10:50,242 --> 00:10:54,966
Upar Export button se dashboard ki report
download bhi kar sakte hain.

148
00:11:01,048 --> 00:11:05,589
Medoro mein medicines ka poora master Stock
screen par hai.

149
00:11:05,629 --> 00:11:11,025
Har medicine ke saath uska salt, schedule, kul
stock, agli expiry, MRP

150
00:11:11,065 --> 00:11:13,276
aur rack location dikhta hai.

151
00:11:14,035 --> 00:11:18,285
Medicine ko brand name, salt ya barcode se khoj
sakte hain.

152
00:11:18,325 --> 00:11:23,884
Jaise salt mein Paracetamol likhne par us salt
ki saari brands aa jaati hain.

153
00:11:24,627 --> 00:11:27,133
Ab nayi medicine jodte hain.

154
00:11:27,173 --> 00:11:30,044
'Add medicine' par click kijiye.

155
00:11:30,084 --> 00:11:37,137
Naam, salt, MRP, GST rate, pack size, loose
unit, reorder level, rack, barcode

156
00:11:37,177 --> 00:11:40,411
aur schedule, sab yahin bharte hain.

157
00:11:41,164 --> 00:11:45,486
MRP paintaalees rupaye prati strip, GST paanch
pratishat.

158
00:11:45,526 --> 00:11:49,619
Ek strip mein das tablets, aur loose bikri ki
anumati,

159
00:11:49,659 --> 00:11:53,751
taaki zaroorat padne par ek-do tablet bhi bech
sakein.

160
00:11:54,516 --> 00:12:00,080
Reorder level pandrah strips, rack A3, aur pack
par chhapa barcode.

161
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:05,684
Yeh medicine Schedule H mein nahi hai, isliye
schedule None rahega.

162
00:12:05,724 --> 00:12:06,939
Ab Save kijiye.

163
00:12:07,715 --> 00:12:09,920
Nayi medicine list mein aa gayi.

164
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:15,883
Abhi iska stock shoonya hai; batch aur expiry ke
saath stock purchase bill se aayega,

165
00:12:15,923 --> 00:12:18,689
jo hum Purchase wale part mein dekhenge.

166
00:12:19,432 --> 00:12:23,601
Kisi medicine ko edit karne ke liye pencil icon
dabaaiye.

167
00:12:23,641 --> 00:12:29,140
Maan lijiye Paracip 650 ki rack badalni hai aur
reorder level badhaana hai.

168
00:12:29,885 --> 00:12:33,589
Save karte hi badlaav har counter par pahunch
jaata hai.

169
00:12:33,629 --> 00:12:36,063
Aur agar koi medicine ab nahi bechni,

170
00:12:36,103 --> 00:12:42,148
to use delete karne ki bajaay 'In use' ka tick
hata dijiye; woh billing se chhip jaati hai,

171
00:12:42,188 --> 00:12:44,689
par uska purana record bana rehta hai.

172
00:12:45,459 --> 00:12:51,547
Batch wale icon se har batch ki expiry, bacha
stock aur status dikhta hai.

173
00:12:51,587 --> 00:12:56,267
HSN code, GST aur MRP har bill par apne-aap
chhapte hain.

174
00:13:02,324 --> 00:13:05,915
Inventory part mein hum stock sambhaalna
seekhenge.

175
00:13:05,955 --> 00:13:11,326
Stock screen par har medicine ka kul stock, agli
expiry aur rack dikhta hai.

176
00:13:11,366 --> 00:13:18,091
'Low stock only' tick karne par sirf woh
medicines dikhti hain jo reorder level se neeche
hain.

177
00:13:18,835 --> 00:13:21,901
Doosre billing software se aa rahe hain?

178
00:13:21,941 --> 00:13:25,784
Purani stock list Excel ya CSV mein Import
kijiye.

179
00:13:25,824 --> 00:13:30,132
Medoro pehle preview dikhata hai, har row mein
kya hoga,

180
00:13:30,172 --> 00:13:33,316
aur galti ho to kuch bhi save nahi karta.

181
00:13:34,084 --> 00:13:39,419
Yahan teen naye items hain, thermometer, mask
aur sanitizer, unke batch

182
00:13:39,459 --> 00:13:41,463
aur opening stock ke saath.

183
00:13:41,503 --> 00:13:44,339
Import dabaate hi stock jud jaata hai.

184
00:13:45,097 --> 00:13:47,026
Ab batches dekhte hain.

185
00:13:47,066 --> 00:13:52,078
Paracip 650 ke kai batches hain, alag-alag
expiry ke saath.

186
00:13:52,118 --> 00:13:57,814
Billing par Medoro FEFO niyam chalata hai: First
Expiry, First Out,

187
00:13:57,854 --> 00:14:02,780
yaani jo batch sabse pehle expire hoga, wahi
pehle bikega.

188
00:14:03,523 --> 00:14:09,098
Agar koi strip toot-phoot gayi, to 'Correct
stock' mein kaaran chunkar maatra ghataaiye.

189
00:14:09,138 --> 00:14:12,735
Har adjustment ka kaaran aur samay record mein
rehta hai.

190
00:14:13,475 --> 00:14:18,222
Stock count ke liye, shelf par gini hui maatra
Counted mein daaliye

191
00:14:18,262 --> 00:14:20,365
aur 'Save stock count' kijiye.

192
00:14:20,405 --> 00:14:22,794
Farq apne-aap adjust ho jaata hai.

193
00:14:23,554 --> 00:14:28,067
Branch transfer: Kanke Road branch mein ORS kam
pad gaya hai.

194
00:14:28,107 --> 00:14:32,546
Batch chunkar, branch aur maatra bhariye, aur
Send dabaaiye.

195
00:14:32,586 --> 00:14:37,025
Stock yahan se ghatkar doosri branch mein
pahunch jaata hai.

196
00:14:37,771 --> 00:14:43,260
Batch ka status bhi badal sakte hain: OK to
sell, Quarantine, ya Recalled.

197
00:14:43,300 --> 00:14:49,983
Quarantine ya Recalled batch billing mein nahi
bikta, jab tak aap use waapas OK na karein.

198
00:14:50,740 --> 00:14:54,766
Expiry par nazar rakhne ke liye sidebar mein
Expiry prevention

199
00:14:54,806 --> 00:14:59,028
aur Stock intelligence hain, jahan jaldi expire
hone wale batches

200
00:14:59,068 --> 00:15:01,127
aur reorder ki salaah milti hai.

201
00:15:01,167 --> 00:15:04,930
Reorder level har medicine ke edit form mein set
hota hai.

202
00:15:10,978 --> 00:15:13,078
Distributor se maal aaya hai.

203
00:15:13,118 --> 00:15:19,940
Purchases screen par supplier ka bill do tarah
se daal sakte hain: bill ki file upload karke,

204
00:15:19,980 --> 00:15:21,638
ya haath se type karke.

205
00:15:21,678 --> 00:15:23,630
Abhi hum bill type karenge.

206
00:15:24,373 --> 00:15:25,650
Supplier chuniye.

207
00:15:25,690 --> 00:15:29,057
Naya supplier ho to naam likhkar Add kijiye.

208
00:15:29,097 --> 00:15:33,549
Phir supplier ka bill number aur bill ki
taareekh daaliye.

209
00:15:34,316 --> 00:15:35,588
Ab items jodiye.

210
00:15:35,628 --> 00:15:42,476
Medicine khojiye, aur har line par batch number,
expiry, packs ki ginti, free packs,

211
00:15:42,516 --> 00:15:45,510
GST se pehle ki rate aur MRP bhariye.

212
00:15:45,550 --> 00:15:50,921
Yeh wahi nayi medicine hai jo humne pichhle part
mein banaayi thi.

213
00:15:51,672 --> 00:15:54,745
Doosri line: Paracip 650 ka naya batch.

214
00:15:54,785 --> 00:15:58,736
Free packs ka matlab scheme mein mili muft
strips,

215
00:15:58,776 --> 00:16:02,807
jo stock mein judti hain par unka paisa nahi
lagta.

216
00:16:03,550 --> 00:16:07,627
Neeche bill ka total GST sahit apne-aap banta
hai.

217
00:16:07,667 --> 00:16:11,249
GST har medicine ke GST rate se nikalta hai.

218
00:16:11,289 --> 00:16:17,506
Supplier ke bill se total milaaiye, phir 'Save
bill and add stock' dabaaiye.

219
00:16:17,546 --> 00:16:20,800
Yahi aapka goods receipt, yaani GRN hai.

220
00:16:21,554 --> 00:16:25,762
Stock turant badh gaya, naye batch aur expiry ke
saath.

221
00:16:25,802 --> 00:16:29,007
Supplier ka bakaaya bhi apne-aap jud gaya.

222
00:16:30,018 --> 00:16:33,474
Supplier ko payment Accounts screen se hota hai.

223
00:16:33,514 --> 00:16:37,771
'Suppliers to pay' mein har supplier ka bakaaya
dikhta hai.

224
00:16:37,811 --> 00:16:41,923
Amount, mode aur UTR ya cheque number daalkar
Pay kijiye.

225
00:16:45,051 --> 00:16:51,159
Payment hote hi bakaaya kam ho jaata hai, aur
entry cash book ya bank mein chali jaati hai.

226
00:16:51,199 --> 00:16:55,213
Supplier ko maal waapas bhejna ho, ya expiry
claim karna ho,

227
00:16:55,253 --> 00:16:58,997
to Supplier tools mein Claims aur return ke
vikalp hain.

228
00:17:05,058 --> 00:17:08,203
Har bill haath se type karna zaroori nahi.

229
00:17:08,243 --> 00:17:14,952
Zyaadatar distributors apna bill e-bill file
mein bhi dete hain, CSV, Excel ya text mein.

230
00:17:14,992 --> 00:17:20,032
Supplier tools ki E-bill import se yeh file
seedhe padhi jaati hai.

231
00:17:20,782 --> 00:17:28,959
Ek zaroori baat: PDF ya photo wale bill ko scan
karne wala AI feature Medoro server par OCR
engine se chalta hai.

232
00:17:28,999 --> 00:17:32,159
Is demo server par OCR engine juda nahi hai,

233
00:17:32,199 --> 00:17:35,941
isliye yahan hum e-bill file import dikha rahe
hain.

234
00:17:36,710 --> 00:17:42,216
Pehle supplier chuniye, phir 'Choose bill file'
se distributor ki file chuniye.

235
00:17:42,256 --> 00:17:46,920
Hamaare paas Jharkhand Medical Agencies ki ek
demo e-bill file hai.

236
00:17:47,680 --> 00:17:54,231
Medoro file ke columns pehchaanta hai: item ka
naam, batch, expiry, quantity,

237
00:17:54,271 --> 00:17:57,055
free quantity, rate, MRP aur GST.

238
00:17:57,095 --> 00:18:01,763
Har line ko catalogue ki medicine se milaaya
jaata hai.

239
00:18:02,526 --> 00:18:05,470
Post karne se pehle review zaroori hai.

240
00:18:05,510 --> 00:18:12,281
Har line ki medicine, batch, expiry, maatra aur
rate supplier ke kaagzi bill se milaaiye.

241
00:18:12,321 --> 00:18:18,326
Koi medicine na mile, to use sahi medicine se
jodiye ya nayi medicine banaaiye.

242
00:18:19,075 --> 00:18:22,580
Sab sahi ho to bill number daalkar save kijiye.

243
00:18:22,620 --> 00:18:28,011
Stock, batches aur supplier ka bakaaya, teeno ek
saath update hote hain.

244
00:18:34,076 --> 00:18:36,503
Ab sabse zaroori kaam, billing.

245
00:18:36,543 --> 00:18:41,674
Billing screen keyboard se chalne ke liye bani
hai: F2 se search,

246
00:18:41,714 --> 00:18:46,926
Enter se item cart mein, F4 se bill hold, aur F9
se bill complete.

247
00:18:47,679 --> 00:18:51,480
F2 dabaaiye aur brand ka naam likhiye, jaise
Paracip.

248
00:18:51,520 --> 00:18:55,466
Enter dabaate hi pehli medicine cart mein aa
jaati hai.

249
00:18:56,246 --> 00:19:02,139
Salt se bhi khoj sakte hain: Cetirizine likhne
par usi salt ki medicine milti hai.

250
00:19:02,179 --> 00:19:06,552
Aur barcode scanner se scan kijiye; scanner
kitna bhi tez ho,

251
00:19:06,592 --> 00:19:10,242
wahi medicine cart mein aati hai jiska barcode
hai.

252
00:19:11,019 --> 00:19:17,253
Quantity plus-minus se badliye, aur strip ki
jagah loose tablet bhi chun sakte hain.

253
00:19:17,293 --> 00:19:24,199
Batch aapko nahi chunna padta: Medoro FEFO se
sabse pehle expire hone wala batch lagaata hai.

254
00:19:24,956 --> 00:19:30,007
Customer ka mobile number daalte hi purana
customer pehchaan liya jaata hai.

255
00:19:30,047 --> 00:19:35,432
Discount utna hi de sakte hain jitni role ko
anumati hai; yahan paanch pratishat.

256
00:19:36,208 --> 00:19:39,133
Tabhi doosra customer jaldi mein aata hai.

257
00:19:39,173 --> 00:19:42,875
F4 dabaaiye: yeh bill hold ho jaata hai, cart
khaali,

258
00:19:42,915 --> 00:19:46,899
aur neeche 'Held bills' mein yeh bill intezaar
karta hai.

259
00:19:47,655 --> 00:19:50,563
Doosre customer ka bill: Vitadem C.

260
00:19:50,603 --> 00:19:54,690
Woh aadha cash aur aadha UPI se dena chahte
hain.

261
00:19:54,730 --> 00:19:55,870
Split chuniye,

262
00:19:55,910 --> 00:20:02,861
cash hissa bees rupaye daaliye; baaki rakam UPI
ya card mein apne-aap aa jaati hai.

263
00:20:03,631 --> 00:20:04,631
F9 dabaaiye.

264
00:20:04,671 --> 00:20:10,090
Invoice par dono bhugtaan alag-alag chhapte
hain: cash aur UPI.

265
00:20:10,850 --> 00:20:16,101
Ab pehla bill waapas kholiye: 'Held bills' mein
Resume dabaaiye.

266
00:20:16,141 --> 00:20:20,813
Cart, customer aur discount, sab waise hi laut
aate hain.

267
00:20:20,853 --> 00:20:24,286
Yeh customer UPI se pay kar rahe hain; F9.

268
00:20:25,028 --> 00:20:32,029
Tax invoice par pharmacy ka GSTIN aur drug
licence, har item ka batch, expiry, HSN

269
00:20:32,069 --> 00:20:36,065
aur GST, aur neeche CGST aur SGST chhapte hain.

270
00:20:36,105 --> 00:20:39,414
MRP mein GST pehle se shaamil hota hai.

271
00:20:39,454 --> 00:20:46,283
Print se chhaapiye, ya browser ke print mein
'Save as PDF' chunkar PDF banaaiye.

272
00:20:47,049 --> 00:20:49,051
Aakhir mein card aur credit.

273
00:20:49,091 --> 00:20:51,603
Rakesh ji ke paas credit limit hai,

274
00:20:51,643 --> 00:20:57,436
isliye unke liye Credit option bhi dikhta hai;
rakam unke khaate mein jaati hai.

275
00:20:57,476 --> 00:20:59,915
Yeh bill hum card se le rahe hain.

276
00:21:07,506 --> 00:21:13,830
Schedule H aur H1 ki davaayein sirf registered
doctor ki prescription par bikti hain.

277
00:21:13,870 --> 00:21:17,423
Medoro yeh niyam billing par hi laagu karta hai.

278
00:21:17,463 --> 00:21:24,086
Search list mein aisi medicines ke saath laal
rang mein Sch H ya Sch H1 likha dikhta hai.

279
00:21:24,859 --> 00:21:27,552
Cefidem 200 ek Schedule H1 dava hai.

280
00:21:27,592 --> 00:21:31,804
Ise cart mein daalte hi Prescription section
khulta hai,

281
00:21:31,844 --> 00:21:35,145
aur likha aata hai: Required for Schedule H.

282
00:21:35,915 --> 00:21:42,115
Bina prescriber details ke bill poora karne ki
koshish karein, to Medoro bill nahi banata.

283
00:21:42,155 --> 00:21:44,333
Yeh check hataaya nahi ja sakta.

284
00:21:45,081 --> 00:21:51,523
Ab doctor ka naam, unka registration number, aur
H1 dava ke liye patient ka naam bhariye.

285
00:21:51,563 --> 00:21:55,384
Is demo mein doctor aur patient, dono kaalpanik
hain.

286
00:21:56,145 --> 00:21:56,539
Ab F9.

287
00:21:56,579 --> 00:22:03,054
Bill ban gaya, aur prescriber ka naam aur
registration number invoice par bhi chhapta hai.

288
00:22:03,819 --> 00:22:09,790
Doctors screen par aap prescribing doctors ka
record rakhte hain: naam, qualification,

289
00:22:09,830 --> 00:22:11,957
registration number aur clinic.

290
00:22:11,997 --> 00:22:17,200
'Sales by doctor' mein har doctor ki
prescriptions se hui bikri dikhti hai.

291
00:22:17,964 --> 00:22:22,683
Schedule H1 ka register 'Books & registers'
screen par hai.

292
00:22:22,723 --> 00:22:28,572
Ismein har H1 dava ki bikri darj hai: taareekh,
invoice, patient, doctor,

293
00:22:28,612 --> 00:22:32,767
registration number, dava, batch, expiry aur
maatra.

294
00:22:32,807 --> 00:22:38,333
Kisi line mein jaankari adhoori ho, to woh laal
rang mein dikhti hai.

295
00:22:39,105 --> 00:22:44,217
CSV button se poora register download kijiye, ya
Print se chhaapiye.

296
00:22:44,257 --> 00:22:48,308
Drug inspector ke maangne par yahi register
dikhaaiye.

297
00:22:48,348 --> 00:22:52,778
Medoro legal check ko bypass karne ka koi raasta
nahi deta.

298
00:22:58,825 --> 00:23:03,831
Customers screen par aapke saare customers hain,
unke bakaaya ke saath.

299
00:23:03,871 --> 00:23:06,603
Upar naam ya mobile se khoj sakte hain.

300
00:23:07,358 --> 00:23:11,309
Naya customer jodne ke liye 'Add customer'
dabaaiye.

301
00:23:11,349 --> 00:23:15,376
Naam, mobile, aur business customer ho to uska
GSTIN.

302
00:23:15,416 --> 00:23:21,055
Credit limit tay karti hai ki customer adhiktam
kitna udhaar le sakta hai.

303
00:23:21,828 --> 00:23:26,668
WhatsApp par offers bhejne se pehle customer ki
anumati zaroori hai.

304
00:23:26,708 --> 00:23:29,969
Customer haan kahe, tabhi yeh box tick kijiye.

305
00:23:30,009 --> 00:23:34,921
Yeh consent record mein rehta hai aur kabhi bhi
hataaya ja sakta hai.

306
00:23:35,671 --> 00:23:40,942
Jin customers par udhaar baaki hai, unke aage
bakaaya rakam dikhti hai.

307
00:23:40,982 --> 00:23:44,682
Receive se payment lijiye, cash, UPI ya card
mein.

308
00:23:44,722 --> 00:23:47,974
Remind se WhatsApp par yaad dila sakte hain,

309
00:23:48,014 --> 00:23:52,088
aur Pay link se online payment ka link bhej
sakte hain.

310
00:23:52,864 --> 00:23:58,009
Rakesh ji ne apne udhaar mein se paanch sau
rupaye UPI se jama kiye.

311
00:23:58,049 --> 00:24:02,356
Receive dabaakar amount aur mode chuniye aur
save kijiye.

312
00:24:02,396 --> 00:24:05,025
Unka bakaaya turant ghat jaata hai.

313
00:24:05,773 --> 00:24:11,005
Customer ka poora hisaab 'Books & registers'
mein Customer statement par hai.

314
00:24:11,045 --> 00:24:16,139
Customer chuniye: shuruaati bakaaya, khaate mein
gaye har bill, har vasooli

315
00:24:16,179 --> 00:24:20,521
aur credit note, aur har line ke baad chaalu
bakaaya dikhta hai.

316
00:24:21,291 --> 00:24:26,220
Yeh statement CSV mein download karke ya print
karke customer ko de sakte hain,

317
00:24:26,260 --> 00:24:28,547
taaki hisaab mein koi uljhan na rahe.

318
00:24:34,597 --> 00:24:37,173
Customer dava waapas karne aaya hai.

319
00:24:37,213 --> 00:24:39,571
'Bills & day-end' screen kholiye.

320
00:24:39,611 --> 00:24:45,674
Yahan invoice number, customer ke naam ya mobile
se koi bhi bill dhoondh sakte hain.

321
00:24:46,420 --> 00:24:47,501
Bill mil gaya.

322
00:24:47,541 --> 00:24:49,422
Return par click kijiye.

323
00:24:49,462 --> 00:24:51,664
Bill ki har line dikhti hai,

324
00:24:51,704 --> 00:24:58,149
aur har line par utni hi maatra waapas ho sakti
hai jitni biki thi, usi batch ki.

325
00:24:58,915 --> 00:25:04,142
Waapas aayi maatra daaliye, aur kaaran likhiye,
jaise doctor ne dava badal di.

326
00:25:04,182 --> 00:25:11,436
Condition mein Sealed chunein to dava waapas
stock mein jaati hai; Damaged chunein to stock
mein nahi judti.

327
00:25:12,212 --> 00:25:18,845
Refund kaise hoga, yeh chuniye: cash, UPI, ya
customer ke account mein credit.

328
00:25:18,885 --> 00:25:22,865
Refund ki rakam GST samet apne-aap nikalti hai.

329
00:25:23,628 --> 00:25:29,169
'Issue credit note' dabaate hi credit note banta
hai: stock waapas, refund darj,

330
00:25:29,209 --> 00:25:32,378
aur day-end mein Returns ke neeche dikhta hai.

331
00:25:32,418 --> 00:25:37,471
Bill kabhi edit ya delete nahi hota, isliye
poora itihaas saaf rehta hai.

332
00:25:38,237 --> 00:25:42,578
Day-end summary mein aaj ke bills, cash, UPI,
card, returns

333
00:25:42,618 --> 00:25:46,885
aur drawer mein kitna cash hona chahiye, sab ek
jagah hai.

334
00:25:46,925 --> 00:25:49,930
'Print day-end' se ise chhaap sakte hain.

335
00:25:55,998 --> 00:25:59,849
Suppliers ki jaankari Medoro mein purchase bills
se banti hai.

336
00:25:59,889 --> 00:26:05,058
Accounts screen par 'Suppliers to pay' mein har
supplier ka kul bakaaya dikhta hai.

337
00:26:05,816 --> 00:26:10,622
Har supplier ke aage payment form hai: amount,
mode, jaise cash,

338
00:26:10,662 --> 00:26:14,407
bank transfer ya cheque, aur UTR ya cheque
number.

339
00:26:14,447 --> 00:26:19,253
Pay dabaate hi payment voucher banta hai aur
bakaaya ghatta hai.

340
00:26:20,010 --> 00:26:26,103
Supplier tools mein Pricing tab har medicine ki
supplier-wise khareed dar dikhata hai,

341
00:26:26,143 --> 00:26:31,094
sabse sasta supplier pehle, saath mein landed
cost aur MRP par margin.

342
00:26:31,134 --> 00:26:35,444
Isse pata chalta hai ki agla order kisse lena
faaydemand hai.

343
00:26:36,195 --> 00:26:44,327
Claims tab mein expiry ke kareeb ka maal
supplier ko waapas karne ya credit note lene ka
hisaab rehta hai: kitne din bache,

344
00:26:44,367 --> 00:26:46,719
kitna claim kiya, kitna credit mila.

345
00:26:47,481 --> 00:26:52,441
Aur Cheques screen par suppliers ko diye gaye
post-dated cheques ka record rehta hai,

346
00:26:52,481 --> 00:26:54,617
taaki clearing ki taareekh yaad rahe.

347
00:26:55,364 --> 00:27:01,962
Har supplier ka poora ledger 'Books & registers'
mein Supplier statement par hai: purchase bills,

348
00:27:02,002 --> 00:27:07,643
aapke payments aur supplier ke credit notes,
shuruaati aur aakhri bakaaye ke saath.

349
00:27:07,683 --> 00:27:10,243
Ise supplier ke statement se milaaiye.

350
00:27:16,293 --> 00:27:20,278
Accounts screen par dukaan ka roz ka hisaab hai.

351
00:27:20,318 --> 00:27:27,321
Sabse pehle expense entry: kiraaya, tankhwaah,
bijli, internet, transport, marammat,

352
00:27:27,361 --> 00:27:29,585
stationery ya bank charges.

353
00:27:30,342 --> 00:27:34,862
Category Repairs, amount aath sau pachaas,
bhugtaan cash se,

354
00:27:34,902 --> 00:27:37,597
aur note mein likhiye kya theek hua.

355
00:27:37,637 --> 00:27:40,105
'Add expense for today' dabaaiye.

356
00:27:40,863 --> 00:27:46,255
Cash book mein aaj ka har len-den hai: bikri ka
cash, customers se vasooli,

357
00:27:46,295 --> 00:27:50,239
supplier payments aur kharch, ant mein In, Out
aur Net.

358
00:27:51,017 --> 00:27:54,204
Bank ka hisaab 'UPI & Bank' screen par hai.

359
00:27:54,244 --> 00:28:00,733
Bank statement Excel ya CSV mein upload kijiye;
Medoro har UPI aur bank credit ko bills

360
00:28:00,773 --> 00:28:06,061
aur payments se milaata hai, aur jo nahi mile,
unhein alag dikhata hai.

361
00:28:06,838 --> 00:28:12,629
Munaafa 'Reports & GST' screen par 'Sales and
profit' mein hai: taareekh-vaar bikri,

362
00:28:12,669 --> 00:28:14,365
returns aur gross profit.

363
00:28:14,405 --> 00:28:18,252
Ise CSV mein nikaalkar apne accountant ko de
sakte hain.

364
00:28:19,001 --> 00:28:22,746
Poori kitaabein 'Books & registers' screen par
hain.

365
00:28:22,786 --> 00:28:29,079
Day book mein kisi bhi din ka har len-den
voucher ke roop mein hai: bikri, credit note,

366
00:28:29,119 --> 00:28:33,665
vasooli, khareed, payment aur kharch, har ek ka
naame aur jama.

367
00:28:34,411 --> 00:28:39,794
Trial balance mein har ledger ka naame aur jama
hai, aur upar Balanced likha aata hai,

368
00:28:39,834 --> 00:28:42,064
yaani dono taraf ka jod barabar hai.

369
00:28:42,828 --> 00:28:47,755
Profit & loss mein shuddh bikri, bike maal ki
laagat, sakal munaafa,

370
00:28:47,795 --> 00:28:51,554
har tarah ka kharch, aur aakhir mein shuddh
munaafa.

371
00:28:51,594 --> 00:28:55,352
Taareekh badalkar kisi bhi avadhi ka hisaab
dekhiye.

372
00:28:55,392 --> 00:29:00,393
Cash flow ki alag report abhi nahi hai; paise ka
aana-jaana cash book

373
00:29:00,433 --> 00:29:02,511
aur day book mein dikhta hai.

374
00:29:08,552 --> 00:29:12,615
Medicine ki MRP mein GST pehle se shaamil hota
hai.

375
00:29:12,655 --> 00:29:16,960
Medoro har bill par MRP se taxable value
nikaalta hai,

376
00:29:17,000 --> 00:29:23,960
aur Jharkhand ke andar ki bikri par GST ko CGST
aur SGST mein aadha-aadha baant'ta hai.

377
00:29:24,000 --> 00:29:28,224
Doosre rajya ke GST wale customer par IGST lagta
hai.

378
00:29:28,972 --> 00:29:34,165
Har medicine ka HSN code aur GST rate uske
master mein rehta hai,

379
00:29:34,205 --> 00:29:36,500
jaise medicines ke liye 3004.

380
00:29:36,540 --> 00:29:41,169
'Reports & GST' screen par GST returns wala
hissa dekhiye.

381
00:29:41,910 --> 00:29:43,589
GST month chuniye.

382
00:29:43,629 --> 00:29:50,562
Medoro us mahine ke bills se GSTR-1 banata hai:
B2B, B2C aur HSN summary,

383
00:29:50,602 --> 00:29:54,764
section-wise taxable value aur tax ke saath.

384
00:29:55,508 --> 00:30:02,872
Yahan se GSTR-1 JSON, jo GST portal ke offline
tool mein jaata hai, HSN summary CSV,

385
00:30:02,912 --> 00:30:07,014
aur GSTR-3B ke JSON aur CSV download hote hain.

386
00:30:07,779 --> 00:30:10,214
Aapka CA Tally istemaal karta hai?

387
00:30:10,254 --> 00:30:17,785
'Books & registers' mein Tally export se Tally
Prime ke liye XML banta hai: pehle ledgers yaani
masters,

388
00:30:17,825 --> 00:30:18,804
phir vouchers.

389
00:30:18,844 --> 00:30:24,409
Tally mein Import karte hi bikri, khareed,
payments aur kharch aa jaate hain,

390
00:30:24,449 --> 00:30:27,685
har customer aur supplier ke ledger ke saath.

391
00:30:28,458 --> 00:30:33,303
Bahut zaroori: yeh reports aur exports filing
mein madad ke liye hain.

392
00:30:33,343 --> 00:30:39,304
GST return file karne se pehle inhein apne
accountant ya CA se zaroor check karvaaiye.

393
00:30:45,375 --> 00:30:49,971
Medoro customers ko WhatsApp par bill aur
reminders bhej sakta hai.

394
00:30:50,011 --> 00:30:55,782
WhatsApp screen par aap apni pharmacy ka apna
WhatsApp number QR code se jodte hain,

395
00:30:55,822 --> 00:30:57,789
bilkul WhatsApp Web ki tarah.

396
00:30:58,556 --> 00:31:03,470
Is demo server par WhatsApp juda nahi hai, yahan
'Not linked' dikh raha hai.

397
00:31:03,510 --> 00:31:07,511
Isliye hum asli message bhejkar nahi dikha rahe,
sirf settings

398
00:31:07,551 --> 00:31:09,923
aur tracking screens dikha rahe hain.

399
00:31:10,665 --> 00:31:16,256
Invoice delivery mein 'Auto-send after sale'
chaalu karne par bill apne-aap jaata hai,

400
00:31:16,296 --> 00:31:19,988
par sirf un customers ko jinki WhatsApp consent
darj hai.

401
00:31:20,028 --> 00:31:23,917
'Attach the invoice PDF' se bill ka PDF bhi
saath jaata hai.

402
00:31:24,670 --> 00:31:29,281
Neeche Sent, Delivered, Read aur Failed ki ginti
aur delivery log hai,

403
00:31:29,321 --> 00:31:32,471
jahan har message ki delivery status dikhti hai.

404
00:31:33,253 --> 00:31:36,288
Customer messaging mein refill reminders hain,

405
00:31:36,328 --> 00:31:44,642
jo sirf is baat par chalte hain ki customer koi
dava kitne din mein dobara leta hai; Medoro
beemaari ka andaaza nahi lagaata.

406
00:31:44,682 --> 00:31:48,519
Saath mein feedback aur weekly payment reminders
bhi hain.

407
00:31:49,298 --> 00:31:53,651
Messages sirf unhi customers ko jaate hain
jinhone haan kaha hai.

408
00:31:53,691 --> 00:31:57,571
Customer STOP likhkar kabhi bhi opt-out kar
sakta hai, aur

409
00:31:57,611 --> 00:32:00,544
phir use koi promotional message nahi jaata.

410
00:32:06,617 --> 00:32:12,707
Ask screen par aap apni pharmacy ke baare mein
seedhi bhaasha mein sawaal poochh sakte hain.

411
00:32:12,747 --> 00:32:16,971
Jawaab isi counter ke apne data se, built-in
rules se aate hain,

412
00:32:17,011 --> 00:32:19,569
aur internet na ho tab bhi chalte hain.

413
00:32:20,343 --> 00:32:24,565
English mein poochhte hain: What are today's
total sales?

414
00:32:24,605 --> 00:32:29,424
Jawaab mein aaj ki kul bikri, bills ki ginti,
aur cash, UPI, card

415
00:32:29,464 --> 00:32:35,480
aur credit ka hissa aata hai, saath mein yeh bhi
ki aankde kis data se liye gaye.

416
00:32:36,255 --> 00:32:38,619
Ab: Which medicines are running low?

417
00:32:38,659 --> 00:32:44,696
Jawaab mein reorder level se neeche wali
medicines aur kitna order karna hai, yeh aata
hai.

418
00:32:45,469 --> 00:32:48,156
Aur: Which batches are expiring soon?

419
00:32:48,196 --> 00:32:53,832
Agle tees din mein koi batch expire nahi ho
raha, yeh saaf bataaya jaata hai.

420
00:32:53,872 --> 00:32:59,877
Nabbe din poochhein, to woh batches unki maatra
aur laagat ke saath aa jaate hain.

421
00:33:00,641 --> 00:33:03,595
Ab Hindi mein: Aaj ki total sale kitni hai?

422
00:33:07,778 --> 00:33:09,653
Kaunsi medicines ka stock kam hai?

423
00:33:15,290 --> 00:33:19,025
Hinglish mein: Is month ka total profit kitna
hua?

424
00:33:19,065 --> 00:33:25,065
Jawaab mein shuddh bikri, bike maal ki laagat,
sakal munaafa aur margin, kharch,

425
00:33:25,105 --> 00:33:28,161
aur aakhir mein shuddh munaafa ya ghaata.

426
00:33:28,201 --> 00:33:35,032
Is demo mahine mein kiraaya aur tankhwaah bikri
se zyaada hai, isliye ghaata dikh raha hai.

427
00:33:35,072 --> 00:33:38,354
Munaafe ke aankde sirf owner ko dikhte hain.

428
00:33:39,107 --> 00:33:42,075
Aur: Kaun se medicines reorder karne hain?

429
00:33:42,115 --> 00:33:50,025
Kisi bhi faisle se pehle aankde khud check
kijiye; har jawaab ke neeche likha hota hai ki
woh kis data se bana.

430
00:33:50,768 --> 00:34:01,090
Purchase order banaane ke liye Insights screen
par reorder ki salaah ko Order list mein jodiye;
list aap khud review karke supplier ko bhejte hain.

431
00:34:01,130 --> 00:34:03,698
Upar 'Ask AI' wala assistant bhi hai.

432
00:34:03,738 --> 00:34:09,338
Dhyan rahe: Medoro ka AI doctor nahi hai, yeh
dava ya ilaaj ki salaah nahi deta.

433
00:34:15,385 --> 00:34:19,658
Medoro ka counter aapke device par hi apna
database rakhta hai,

434
00:34:19,698 --> 00:34:23,698
isliye internet band hone par bhi billing chalti
rehti hai.

435
00:34:23,738 --> 00:34:30,065
Counter screen par ek Counter PIN set kijiye;
offline hone par isi PIN se counter khulta hai.

436
00:34:30,842 --> 00:34:34,226
Ab is demo browser ka internet band karte hain.

437
00:34:34,266 --> 00:34:39,254
Sirf yahi browser offline hoga; baaki koi system
nahi chheda ja raha.

438
00:34:40,021 --> 00:34:42,730
Upar Live ki jagah offline dikhega.

439
00:34:42,770 --> 00:34:49,093
Phir bhi bill banaaiye: medicine khojiye, cart
mein daaliye, Cash chuniye aur F9.

440
00:34:49,866 --> 00:34:52,818
Bill ban gaya aur isi device par save ho gaya.

441
00:34:52,858 --> 00:34:56,655
Google Drive wale box mein 'Changes waiting'
badh gaya hai,

442
00:34:56,695 --> 00:35:00,298
yaani yeh badlaav upload hone ka intezaar kar
rahe hain.

443
00:35:01,070 --> 00:35:03,475
Ab internet waapas chaalu karte hain.

444
00:35:03,515 --> 00:35:04,797
'Sync now' dabaaiye,

445
00:35:04,837 --> 00:35:10,415
ya thoda rukiye; badlaav apne-aap encrypted
hokar Google Drive mein chale jaate hain,

446
00:35:10,455 --> 00:35:13,587
aur 'Changes waiting' phir shoonya ho jaata hai.

447
00:35:14,363 --> 00:35:18,260
Do counters ne offline rehte ek hi batch bech
diya ho,

448
00:35:18,300 --> 00:35:22,052
to sync ke baad woh batch minus mein dikh sakta
hai.

449
00:35:22,092 --> 00:35:28,031
Stock tab par laal ginti aati hai, aur stock
count karke use theek kiya jaata hai.

450
00:35:28,071 --> 00:35:30,583
Bills kabhi mit'te ya badalte nahi.

451
00:35:36,638 --> 00:35:42,241
Medoro Demo Pharmacy ki do branches hain: Main
Road, do counters ke saath,

452
00:35:42,281 --> 00:35:44,986
aur Kanke Road, ek counter ke saath.

453
00:35:45,026 --> 00:35:49,485
Branches 'Users & branches' screen se sambhaali
jaati hain.

454
00:35:50,258 --> 00:35:56,285
Yahan nayi branch jod sakte hain aur har branch
ke counters ki sankhya tay kar sakte hain.

455
00:35:56,325 --> 00:36:01,207
Upar branch ka naam badalkar aap kisi bhi branch
ka data dekh sakte hain.

456
00:36:01,947 --> 00:36:08,592
Staff ko branch ke hisaab se joda jaata hai;
udaaharan ke liye humne Kanke Road ke liye
pharmacist

457
00:36:08,632 --> 00:36:10,706
aur cashier ko invite kiya tha.

458
00:36:10,746 --> 00:36:13,435
Permissions hum agle part mein dekhenge.

459
00:36:14,194 --> 00:36:21,022
Stock transfer humne Inventory part mein dekha
tha: batch se maatra chunkar doosri branch ko
Send.

460
00:36:21,062 --> 00:36:25,788
Transfers ka record isi 'Branches & transfers'
hisse mein rehta hai.

461
00:36:26,561 --> 00:36:31,890
Sabhi branches ki ek saath tasveer Owner view
mein hai: har branch ki aaj

462
00:36:31,930 --> 00:36:37,699
aur kal ki bikri, drawers mein cash, low stock
aur expiry, sab branches jodkar.

463
00:36:37,739 --> 00:36:40,788
Yeh screen phone par bhi achhi chalti hai.

464
00:36:41,563 --> 00:36:46,577
Dhyan dein: Google Drive wale hosted setup mein
bills counters par rehte hain,

465
00:36:46,617 --> 00:36:50,595
isliye Owner view ke aankde Medoro server ki
copy se aate hain

466
00:36:50,635 --> 00:36:58,047
aur yahan shoonya dikh sakte hain; har counter
ki asli bikri uske Dashboard par Branch
performance mein dikhti hai.

467
00:37:04,109 --> 00:37:09,260
Users screen par har user ka role, branch,
two-step verification ki sthiti

468
00:37:09,300 --> 00:37:12,276
aur aakhri baar kab active tha, dikhta hai.

469
00:37:13,034 --> 00:37:16,926
Naya staff jodne ke liye 'Add employee'
dabaaiye.

470
00:37:16,966 --> 00:37:19,333
Naam, role aur branch chuniye.

471
00:37:19,373 --> 00:37:23,826
Counter staff, jaise cashier, pharmacy code,
employee ID

472
00:37:23,866 --> 00:37:30,004
aur PIN se login karte hain; owner aur manager
password aur authenticator se.

473
00:37:30,784 --> 00:37:36,448
'Roles & permissions' mein har role ke adhikaar
tay hote hain: Owner, Manager,

474
00:37:36,488 --> 00:37:39,738
Pharmacist, Cashier, Accountant aur Delivery.

475
00:37:39,778 --> 00:37:45,149
Jaise cashier bill bana sakta hai, par purchase
ya report nahi dekh sakta,

476
00:37:45,189 --> 00:37:48,586
aur discount ki seema bhi role se tay hoti hai.

477
00:37:49,357 --> 00:37:54,699
Owner upar 'View as' se dekh sakta hai ki kisi
role ko screen kaisi dikhti hai.

478
00:37:54,739 --> 00:38:01,852
Jaise 'View as Cashier' chunne par sidebar mein
sirf wahi options bachte hain jo cashier ke kaam
ke hain.

479
00:38:02,604 --> 00:38:09,171
Audit trail mein har zaroori kaam ka record hai:
kisne, kab, kya badla, jaise login,

480
00:38:09,211 --> 00:38:12,789
sign-up, user invite ya settings mein badlaav.

481
00:38:12,829 --> 00:38:14,834
Ise mitaaya nahi ja sakta.

482
00:38:15,585 --> 00:38:20,949
Counter par har user ka kaam Activity screen par
bhi dikhta hai: kaunsa bill,

483
00:38:20,989 --> 00:38:23,055
kaunsa payment, kisne banaaya.

484
00:38:23,095 --> 00:38:28,530
Login security ke liye two-step verification,
paanch galat koshishon par lock,

485
00:38:28,570 --> 00:38:33,724
aur 'Profile & sessions' se baaki devices ko
sign out karne ka vikalp hai.

486
00:38:39,781 --> 00:38:43,078
Medoro mein aapki pharmacy ka data aapka hai.

487
00:38:43,118 --> 00:38:46,489
Bills, stock aur customers aapke counters par,

488
00:38:46,529 --> 00:38:49,751
aur aapke apne Google Drive mein rehte hain,

489
00:38:49,791 --> 00:38:53,237
us key se encrypt hokar jo sirf aapke paas hai.

490
00:38:53,277 --> 00:38:57,982
Medoro ke paas sirf aapka account aur devices ki
list rehti hai.

491
00:38:58,739 --> 00:39:02,762
Counter har badlaav kuch seconds mein Drive mein
bhejta hai,

492
00:39:02,802 --> 00:39:05,132
aur samay-samay par poori copy bhi.

493
00:39:05,172 --> 00:39:08,992
Yeh files Drive ke hidden app data hisse mein
rehti hain.

494
00:39:09,032 --> 00:39:12,242
Is demo server par asli Google sign-in nahi hai,

495
00:39:12,282 --> 00:39:16,102
isliye Google Drive ka test version istemaal ho
raha hai.

496
00:39:16,872 --> 00:39:19,771
Restore: naya ya reset kiya hua counter,

497
00:39:19,811 --> 00:39:25,722
Drive recovery code se sab kuch waapas le aata
hai, har medicine, batch, customer

498
00:39:25,762 --> 00:39:26,383
aur bill.

499
00:39:26,423 --> 00:39:26,971
Yeh code

500
00:39:27,011 --> 00:39:34,024
aur sign-up wali recovery kit offline
sambhaalkar rakhiye; Medoro inhein recover nahi
kar sakta.

501
00:39:34,064 --> 00:39:37,697
Video mein koi key ya code nahi dikhaaya gaya
hai.

502
00:39:38,444 --> 00:39:41,461
'Privacy & data' screen par data controls hain.

503
00:39:41,501 --> 00:39:46,339
Strict customer-controlled mode mein customers
ke mobile numbers sirf owner

504
00:39:46,379 --> 00:39:48,486
aur manager ko poore dikhte hain,

505
00:39:48,526 --> 00:39:52,258
aur export mein number tabhi jaata hai jab
kaaran darj ho.

506
00:39:53,011 --> 00:39:56,579
Yahin se aap apna poora data export kar sakte
hain,

507
00:39:56,619 --> 00:40:00,894
aur zaroorat ho to kisi customer ka data mita
bhi sakte hain.

508
00:40:00,934 --> 00:40:06,906
Integration health screen batata hai ki kya juda
hai, kya test hua, aur kya fail hua.

509
00:40:12,985 --> 00:40:17,126
'Reports & GST' screen par 'Sales and profit'
report hai.

510
00:40:17,166 --> 00:40:22,774
From aur To taareekh chuniye; har din ke bills,
bikri aur munaafa dikhta hai,

511
00:40:22,814 --> 00:40:26,368
aur CSV button se poori report download hoti
hai.

512
00:40:27,148 --> 00:40:30,807
Best sellers mein sabse zyaada bikne wali
medicines hain,

513
00:40:30,847 --> 00:40:34,441
aur 'Expiring in 90 days' mein aane wali expiry
ki list.

514
00:40:35,190 --> 00:40:40,488
Insights screen mein gehra analysis hai: har
medicine ki bikri ka forecast,

515
00:40:40,528 --> 00:40:46,609
reorder ki salaah, dheemi ya bilkul na bikne
wali dead stock, stock in hand ki keemat,

516
00:40:46,649 --> 00:40:47,463
aur margins.

517
00:40:48,209 --> 00:40:53,415
Audit anomalies mein owner ke liye sanket hain,
jaise raat mein bane bills,

518
00:40:53,455 --> 00:40:55,723
zyaada discount ya bahut refunds.

519
00:40:55,763 --> 00:40:59,920
Yeh galti ka saboot nahi, sirf jaanchne laayak
baatein hain.

520
00:41:00,684 --> 00:41:06,927
Hisaab-kitaab ki reports 'Books & registers'
mein hain: profit and loss, trial balance,

521
00:41:06,967 --> 00:41:12,850
day book, customer aur supplier statements,
Schedule H1 register aur Tally export,

522
00:41:12,890 --> 00:41:15,016
har ek CSV aur print ke saath.

523
00:41:15,777 --> 00:41:20,680
Customer outstanding Customers screen par,
supplier outstanding Accounts mein,

524
00:41:20,720 --> 00:41:22,771
GST reports 'Reports & GST' mein,

525
00:41:22,811 --> 00:41:26,891
aur branch report dashboard ke Branch
performance mein milti hai.

526
00:41:32,952 --> 00:41:37,567
Medoro ka saat din ka free trial bina card ke
shuru hota hai.

527
00:41:37,607 --> 00:41:41,536
Plans aur keematein medoro.in par Pricing mein
hain.

528
00:41:41,576 --> 00:41:43,139
Yeh live website hai.

529
00:41:43,899 --> 00:41:49,016
Plans ki tulna kijiye: branches, counters, users
aur add-ons.

530
00:41:49,056 --> 00:41:53,327
Sahi plan apni dukaan ke size ke hisaab se
chuniye.

531
00:41:54,071 --> 00:41:59,987
App ke andar Subscription screen par aapka plan,
usmein kya shaamil hai, aur payments

532
00:42:00,027 --> 00:42:02,229
aur Medoro invoices dikhte hain.

533
00:42:02,269 --> 00:42:06,293
Yeh demo server Medoro ke licence server se juda
nahi hai,

534
00:42:06,333 --> 00:42:09,797
isliye yahan trial ki jagah Self-hosted likha
hai.

535
00:42:10,552 --> 00:42:16,113
Upgrade ya renew ke liye 'Renew or pay' mein UPI
ya card se bhugtaan hota hai.

536
00:42:16,153 --> 00:42:19,704
Is video mein koi asli payment nahi kiya gaya
hai.

537
00:42:19,744 --> 00:42:27,532
Cancel karna ho to Medoro support se baat
kijiye; aapka data aapke Google Drive mein aapke
paas hi rehta hai.

538
00:42:33,608 --> 00:42:36,643
Medoro poora Hindi mein bhi chalta hai.

539
00:42:36,683 --> 00:42:39,167
Upar EN aur Hindi ka switch hai.

540
00:42:39,207 --> 00:42:40,980
Hindi par click kijiye.

541
00:42:41,733 --> 00:42:46,343
Ab sidebar, dashboard, button aur messages, sab
Hindi mein hain.

542
00:42:46,383 --> 00:42:51,210
Medicines ke naam aur bill par zaroori jaankari
waisi hi rehti hai.

543
00:42:51,973 --> 00:42:54,574
Billing screen bhi Hindi mein dekhiye.

544
00:42:54,614 --> 00:43:00,689
Har user apni bhaasha alag chun sakta hai; yeh
pasand usi ke account par yaad rehti hai.

545
00:43:01,450 --> 00:43:07,646
Ask screen par Hindi ya Hinglish mein sawaal
poochhiye, jaise: Aaj ki total sale kitni hai?

546
00:43:09,945 --> 00:43:12,894
Waapas English ke liye EN par click kijiye.

547
00:43:12,934 --> 00:43:16,995
Sign-up ke samay bhi interface language chuni ja
sakti hai.

548
00:43:23,070 --> 00:43:25,105
Ab ek poora din dekhte hain.

549
00:43:25,145 --> 00:43:30,885
Subah owner login karta hai aur dashboard par
kal ki bikri, bakaaya, low stock

550
00:43:30,925 --> 00:43:32,515
aur expiry dekhta hai.

551
00:43:33,290 --> 00:43:36,914
Stock mein low stock aur expiry check hoti hai.

552
00:43:36,954 --> 00:43:38,473
Montidem LC kam hai.

553
00:43:40,453 --> 00:43:43,603
Gyaarah baje Birsa Healthcare se maal aata hai.

554
00:43:43,643 --> 00:43:48,898
Purchase bill type karke save karte hi GRN banta
hai aur stock badh jaata hai.

555
00:43:53,488 --> 00:43:55,744
Dopahar mein customer aata hai.

556
00:43:55,784 --> 00:44:02,261
Staff search box mein medicine khojta hai,
customer ka mobile daalta hai, UPI chunta hai

557
00:44:02,301 --> 00:44:04,186
aur F9 se bill banata hai.

558
00:44:07,184 --> 00:44:12,527
Invoice print hota hai, ya WhatsApp juda ho to
customer ko bheja jaata hai.

559
00:44:12,567 --> 00:44:14,322
Stock apne-aap ghat gaya.

560
00:44:15,085 --> 00:44:18,416
Shaam ko ek customer sealed strip waapas karta
hai.

561
00:44:18,456 --> 00:44:22,317
Bills screen se bill dhoondhkar return aur
refund hota hai.

562
00:44:25,408 --> 00:44:31,071
Din ke ant mein owner day-end dekhta hai, phir
Books mein profit and loss se munaafa

563
00:44:31,111 --> 00:44:34,738
aur kharch, aur reports apne accountant ko
bhejta hai.

564
00:44:34,778 --> 00:44:37,318
Yahi hai Medoro ke saath ek poora din.

565
00:44:43,383 --> 00:44:46,854
To yeh tha Medoro Pharmacy ka poora tour.

566
00:44:46,894 --> 00:44:53,792
Billing, inventory, purchase, GST, accounts aur
AI assistant, sab ek jagah, Hindi

567
00:44:53,832 --> 00:44:55,676
aur English dono mein.

568
00:44:56,438 --> 00:45:03,000
Medical store owner ke liye iska matlab hai: tez
billing, FEFO se kam expiry ka nuksaan,

569
00:45:03,040 --> 00:45:06,075
samay par GST reports, bakaaye par nazar,

570
00:45:06,115 --> 00:45:10,501
aur data jo hamesha aapke apne Google Drive mein
rehta hai.

571
00:45:11,254 --> 00:45:16,825
Aaj hi medoro.in par jaaiye aur 'Start 7-day
free trial' par click kijiye.

572
00:45:16,865 --> 00:45:18,493
Koi card nahi chahiye.

573
00:45:19,254 --> 00:45:24,420
Demo chahiye to 'Book a demo' se WhatsApp par
Medoro team se baat kijiye.

574
00:45:24,460 --> 00:45:28,413
Dhanyavaad, aur aapki pharmacy ke liye
shubhkaamnaayein!
